{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-sky-gardens","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"sky-gardens-avenew-properties-difc-dubai-international-financial-center","about":"Sky Gardens is a premium development by developer AveNew, located in the DIFC (Dubai International Financial Centre) district of Dubai. This magnificent 40-storey development occupies a central position in the city's business and financial centre, embodying elegance, comfort and luxury.Sky Gardens offers a wide range of accommodation including studios and 1-3 bedroom apartments. The architectural design of the development features glass facades, high ceilings and spacious balconies with breathtaking views of the city and surrounding green spaces.Residents of Sky Gardens can enjoy rich infrastructural amenities including outdoor and indoor swimming pools, sports courts, fitness centre, spa, children's playgrounds, recreational areas and many other modern amenities. In addition, the residential complex's location in the DIFC area provides easy access to business centres, high-end restaurants, shopping malls and other key facilities in the city.The complex's strategic location allows residents to quickly access key attractions in Dubai. The Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are 9 minutes away, Dubai International Airport is 17 minutes away and the Burj Al Arab is approximately 20 minutes away.Sky Gardens is the ideal location for those who appreciate comfort, luxury and a modern lifestyle in the heart of Dubai.","price":2036078,"title":"Sky Gardens","bitrix":{"id":560,"pf_id":"are.2.2664","source":null,"project_id":"Sky Gardens","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Sky Gardens","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"AveNew Properties","project_location":"DIFC"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/92/images/2024/04/10/340x252/Joc703UEszbQz4Xzk6b9ei7ZPzenmXPHckiZ8A7m.webp","464x312":"ht